-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_LOW_AtelierDoorNote</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_AtelierDoorNote\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_AtelierDoorNote\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">eda67de2-1682-4fda-9402-2bd948a3e3ab</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:eda67de2-1682-4fda-9402-2bd948a3e3ab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:eda67de2-1682-4fda-9402-2bd948a3e3ab\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>First floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Lady_Jannath%27s_Estate\" title=\"Lady Jannath's Estate\">Lady Jannath's Estate</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A quickly scrawled invoice of work completed.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><b>Record of Work:</b> 29 Tarsakh 1492DR.\n</p><p><b>Completed installation:</b> Sliding door (concealed) to cubby in atelier. \n</p><p><b>Initial quote:</b> 500 gold\n</p><p><b>Final invoice:</b> 575 gold (additional cost: structural reinforcements after door installation, making it 'more secret ' per client req.)\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202945\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.048 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1343/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23086/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5378/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936018/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.774      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   40.774      1 -total\n 51.22%   20.884      6 Template:Icon_text\n 45.42%   18.518     15 Template:Trim\n 24.42%    9.958      2 Template:Uid\n 15.90%    6.482      1 Template:Main_only\n 14.04%    5.723      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.83%    4.415      1 Template:Notes\n 10.15%    4.138      1 Template:Icon_link\n 10.11%    4.121      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12654-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202945 and revision id 365512. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}